# VeriFinca — Stitch UI Alignment & Design System Migration

## Goal

Align all 11 existing frontend pages with the **DESIGN.md** specification (Stitch "Legal Architect" design system). The current codebase already has functional pages, but they use an older token set (`tokens.css` / `global.css`) that diverges from the DESIGN.md. This plan reconciles the two, upgrades the design tokens, and ensures every screen follows the Stitch patterns.

---

## Resolved Decisions (from User Confirmation)

1. **Token Naming Convention:** Migrating fully to DESIGN.md's `--color-primary` / `--color-secondary` naming. Canonical names will be used with backward aliases temporarily if needed.
2. **tokens.css Delete:** Safe to remove `src/styles/tokens.css` once `global.css` is updated.
3. **Backend Auth Integration:** LoginPage will use mock handlers until real JWT is connected (Blocked by backend blocks 15+).

---

## Phase 0 — Design Token Reconciliation

The core issue: `global.css` defines tokens that **conflict** with DESIGN.md. We must migrate without breaking existing components.

### Gap Analysis

| Current Token | Current Value | DESIGN.md Token | DESIGN.md Value |
|---|---|---|---|
| `--color-brand-primary` | `#2c3b4e` (dark blue-gray) | `--color-primary` | `#F98513` (orange) |
| `--color-brand-secondary` | `#a35139` | `--color-secondary` | `#223382` (deep blue) |
| `--color-brand-accent` | `#f54f1b` | (maps to `--color-primary`) | `#F98513` |
| `--color-brand-accent-soft` | `#feb161` | `--color-tertiary` | `#9BACD8` |
| `--color-surface-base` | `#ede9de` | `--color-neutral` | `#DAD1C8` |
| `--color-surface-alt` | `#e6d5b7` | `--color-surface-raised` | `#F5F0EA` |
| `--color-text-strong` | `#1c2632` | `--color-text-primary` | `#1A1A1A` |
| Font display | `General Sans` | Font display | `Manrope` |

### Strategy: **Dual-Layer Token System**

1. Update `global.css` to define the **DESIGN.md canonical tokens** as the source of truth.
2. Add **backward-compatible aliases** so existing components don't break immediately.
3. Migrate components screen-by-screen from aliases to canonical tokens.

---

### [MODIFY] global.css

- Replace the `@theme` block with DESIGN.md canonical tokens.
- Add backward aliases for `--color-brand-*` → new tokens.
- Update `.vf-card`, `.vf-btn-*`, `.vf-badge-*`, `.vf-input` to use new tokens.
- Add Manrope font import and reassign `--font-display`.
- Update card styles: `background: #FFFFFF`, `border-radius: 12px`, shadow per DESIGN.md.
- Update button styles: Primary `#F98513`, Secondary outlined `#223382`.

### [DELETE] tokens.css

- Remove this file.

---

## Phase 1 — Public Pages (Priority 1)

These are the user-visible, SEO-critical pages.

### 1.1 Landing Page
- **HeroSection:** Migrate `bg-[var(--color-brand-primary)]` → `bg-[var(--color-primary)]`.
- **LandingNav:** Update brand color references. Use Manrope.
- **ProjectsShowcase:** Update card styles (`#FFFFFF` bg, `12px` radius, `#C8BFB5` border).
- **VerificationSection:** Orange bg → `--color-primary`.
- **Footer:** Update to `--color-secondary` (`#223382`).

### 1.2 Projects Public List
- Update header bg and search card to DESIGN.md tokens.
- Update project cards. Migrate badge classes.

### 1.3 Project Public Detail
- Header bg → `--color-primary`.
- Info card → DESIGN.md border/shadow. Integrity badge colors aligned.

### 1.4 Public Verification Page
- Input focus state → `border-color: #F98513`.

